  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "A major fire recently occurred at the PT Fonusa Agung Mulia (PT FAM) candy factory located in Cikande, Indonesia, resulting in significant casualties. Forensic teams from the Indonesian National Police (Pusdokkes Polri) are currently conducting DNA examinations to identify recovered remains, with efforts expected to continue over several days. Authorities have noted that the search and rescue process is facing considerable challenges, including hazardous building rubble and frequent rainstorms. Labor representatives have raised concerns regarding operational safety standards at the facility and have requested that the company provide significant financial compensation to the affected families. As of the latest reports, dozens of workers remain missing as emergency teams navigate the unsafe environment to locate further victims.",
